wait 2
title launch
type /version
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap version
type /version now
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap version-now
type /nosuch
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap nosuch
type /version 
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap version-trailing-space
title before-quit
keep
type /quit
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
title quit
